{"id":"huntik:page:2741","page_id":2741,"title":"The Golem of Prague","kind":"supporting_page","namespace":0,"summary":"The Golem of Prague was a mission assigned to Dante Vale in to investigate the golem in Jodis Lore's tomb in Prague Central Cemetery. After dark, the team, including first-time member Zhalia Moon, went to Central Cemetery and unlocked a secret passageway in Jodis Lore's tomb. Although the Organization claimed Jodis Lore's Key, Dante Vale's team managed to create a copy of the key and to set a trap in Jodis Lore's chamber on the Road of Alchemists. After another confrontation with the Organization members, Lok finally began to realize his Seeker powers. The golem of the legend was discovered to be the Titan, Metagolem, and Dante Vale secured the amulet when he managed to bond with this Titan.","profile":{"image":{"text":"File:The_Golem_of_Prague_Mission.png","wikitext":"File:The_Golem_of_Prague_Mission.png","links":[]},"city":{"text":"Prague, Czech Republic","wikitext":"[[Prague, Czech Republic]]","links":[{"target_title":"Prague, Czech Republic","label":"Prague, Czech Republic","target_id":"huntik:page:8072","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Prague%2C_Czech_Republic","status":"resolved","href":"#/categories?name=Prague%2C%20Czech%20Republic"}]},"location":{"text":"Prague Central Cemetery \n Road of Alchemists","wikitext":"[[Prague Central Cemetery]] <br> [[Road of Alchemists]]","links":[{"target_title":"Prague Central Cemetery","label":"Prague Central Cemetery","target_id":"huntik:page:2745","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Prague_Central_Cemetery","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2745"},{"target_title":"Road of Alchemists","label":"Road of Alchemists","target_id":"huntik:page:2736","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Road_of_Alchemists","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2736"}]},"members":{"text":"Dante Vale \n Lok Lambert \n Sophie Casterwill \n Zhalia Moon","wikitext":"[[Dante 