terwill","label":"Sophie Casterwill","target_id":"huntik:page:2041","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Sophie_Casterwill","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2041"},{"target_title":"Zhalia Moon","label":"Zhalia Moon","target_id":"huntik:page:2000","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Zhalia_Moon","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2000"}]},{"name":"objectives","value_wikitext":"{{*}} Reach the [[Prague Central Cemetery]] <br>{{*}} Find and access [[Jodis Lore]]'s Tomb <br>{{*}} Gather clues about the [[Metagolem|golem]]","value_text":"Reach the Prague Central Cemetery \n Find and access Jodis Lore's Tomb \n Gather clues about the golem","links":[{"target_title":"Prague Central Cemetery","label":"Prague Central Cemetery","target_id":"huntik:page:2745","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Prague_Central_Cemetery","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2745"},{"target_title":"Jodis Lore","label":"Jodis Lore","target_id":"huntik:page:2672","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Jodis_Lore","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2672"},{"target_title":"Metagolem","label":"golem","target_id":"huntik:page:2143","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Metagolem","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2143"}]},{"name":"episode","value_wikitext":"\"[[Words of Truth, Heart of Lies]]\"","value_text":"\"Words of Truth, Heart of Lies\"","links":[{"target_title":"Words of Truth, Heart of Lies","label":"Words of Truth, Heart of Lies","target_id":"huntik:page:2555","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Words_of_Truth%2C_Heart_of_Lies","status":"resolved","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2555"}]}],"start":0,"end":501}],"sections":[],"full_text":"The Golem of Prague was a mission assigned to Dante Vale in to investigate the golem in Jodis Lore's tomb in Prague Central Cemetery. After dark, the team, including first-time member Zhalia Moon, went to Central Cemetery and unlocked a secret passageway in Jodis Lore's tomb. Although the Organization claimed Jodis Lore's Key, Dante Vale's team managed to create a copy of the key and to set a trap in Jodis Lore's chamber on the Road of Alchemists. After another confrontation with the Organization members, Lok finally began to realize his Seeker powers. The golem of the legend was discovered to be the Titan, Metagolem, and Dante Vale secured the amulet when he managed to bond with this Titan.","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox mission\n| image       = File:The_Golem_of_Prague_Mission.png\n| city        = [[Prague, Czech Republic]]\n| location    = [[Prague Central Cemetery]] <br> [[Road of Alchemists]]\n| members     = [[Dante Vale]] <br> [[Lok Lambert]] <br> [[Sophie Casterwill]] <br> [[Zhalia Moon]]\n| objectives  = {{*}} Reach the [[Prague Central Cemetery]] <br>{{*}} Find and access [[Jodis Lore]]'s Tomb <br>{{*}} Gather clues about the [[Metagolem|golem]]\n| episode     = \"[[Words of Truth, Heart of Lies]]\"\n}}\n\n'''The Golem of Prague''' was a mission assigned to [[Dante Vale]] in to investigate the golem in [[Jodis Lore|Jodis Lore's]] tomb in [[Prague Central Cemetery]]. After dark, the team, including first-time member [[Zhalia Moon]], went to Central Cemetery and unlocked a secret passageway in Jodis Lore's tomb. Although [[the Organization]] claimed [[Jodis Lore's Key]], Dante Vale's team managed to create a copy of the key and to set a trap in Jodis Lore's chamber on the [[Road of Alchemists]]. After another confrontation with the Organization members, Lok finally began to realize his Seeker powers. The golem of the legend was discovered to be the Titan, [[Metagolem]], and [[Dante Vale]] secured the amulet when he managed to bond with this Titan.\n[[Category:Huntik Foundation Missions|Golem of Prague]]","categories":["Huntik Foundation Missions"],"links":[{"target_title":"Prague, Czech Republic","label":"Prague, Czech Republic","target_id":"huntik:page:8072","target_url":"https://hunti